        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global Door Controls ADA Compliant Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC2201ADA Door Closer is an economically priced door \r\ncloser for use on both exterior and interior doors in commercial and storefront applications. \r\nThey fit a common 9-1/6\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC2201ADA Door Closers are non handed and, for standard non-hold open or hold open applications. They can be \r\nmounted on regular and top jamb installations. An optional mounting bracket is available for parallel installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC2201ADA is ADA Compliant offering adjustable spring power sizes 1 - 4 for use on interior doors \r\nrequiring less than 5 lbs. of opening force and exterior doors requiring less than 8.5 lbs. UL listed R7483 615R for \"A\" label fire doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available for larger door: <a href=\"/products/tc201-global-grade-1-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>Global TC201 Adjustable Door Closer</b></a></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLO-TC2200-xref.jpg?v=1774586608\" width=\"600\" height=\"161\" border=\"0\" alt=\"TC2200 Cross Reference\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 243 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 44\" interior / 36\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 1-4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf desired, you can add an optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\">Parallel Arm Bracket PAB-2200 and / or Optional Hold Open Arm HOA-1245</a> below.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/global-tc2200-arms.jpg?v=1704354566\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories Arms\"></a>\r\n</p>",
